WEBVTT

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:32.550
The way you live,

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:35.180
you'll burn to death both your enemies
and those you want to protect.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:38.410
All that will remain will be wasteland and loneliness.

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:39.570
Silence!

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:46.460
You're like a scolded child.

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:49.500
I've had enough

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.210
of your words!

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:55.300
I'll make it so you never open
that mouth of yours again!

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.280
What?

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:23.240
<i>Aldebaran...</i>

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:29.870
Kagaho!

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.300
Did you kill Aldebaran?!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.470
Dohko...

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:42.720
You were just a little too late.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.060
What?

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.550
You're too late.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:50.020
That circle of flames restrains my enemy
and burns them to death.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.440
You will only be free of those flames

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.940
when your body is reduced to ash!

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:58.630
Well, it will take some time for that huge body

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:01.300
of yours to be reduced to ash.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.200
Silence...

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:06.450
I just want to kill you. That's all I want.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:09.990
To kill you, the one who hurt Lord Hades.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.830
That fool wanted to get in my way...

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.440
Silence!

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.000
I won't allow you to mock him any longer!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.200
You'll pay for this!

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:27.060
Come! Let's end this,
right here, right now!

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:38.320
Wait.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.620
Aldebaran!

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.200
You're alive?!

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:52.620
Wait! I'll make short work of him!

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.630
Dohko, stand back.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.250
I require no assistance in this fight!

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.870
What are you talking about?

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:01.880
You can't fight in your condition.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:04.010
Have you forgotten, Dohko?

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:06.690
A Saint's battle

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:08.760
is always man-to-man!

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:15.270
As long as I have the will to fight,
you cannot take part in this!

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:17.640
Giant Star Aldebaran...

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:20.280
Cannot be burned away...

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:25.200
by flames like these!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:30.200
<i>How could he break my Crucify Ankh?</i>

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.080
Aldebaran!

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.340
It's not over yet.

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:47.220
Right, Kagaho?

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:51.850
You're still standing,
but after my next move, you won't be.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.430
Sir Aldebaran!

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.070
You...

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:03.700
Saro!

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:04.700
Don't go!

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:05.950
No!

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:10.370
Don't go in!

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:12.120
No!

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.120
But, Sir Aldebaran,

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.870
you're so injured!

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:19.730
I don't want you to die!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.050
You're my big brother... I...

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.340
I don't want you to get hurt...

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:40.020
Why have you come?

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.520
Excuse us!

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.030
Sir Aldebaran!

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:56.910
We're not yet strong enough...

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.420
But we'll become Saints one day,

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:02.420
and we'll stand with you in the next battle!

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:05.670
So...

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:07.170
Please win this one!

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:16.810
I will not lose.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:26.320
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:34.350
I see you have said your goodbyes.

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:39.080
So that is the reason you will never fall.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.530
Yes.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:41.960
I will do anything

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.460
for those kids.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.920
That's a pretty weak reason.

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:55.090
You all, the immortal Specters, don't understand...

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:00.060
Mortal lives that burn brighter also live forever,

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:02.440
as long as there are people to inherit them!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.860
I've had enough of your rambling!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:08.940
I'll vaporize you, so you'll never recover!

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:15.830
<i>Teneo, Saro, Celintha, take a good look!</i>

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.300
Sir Aldebaran!

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:34.300
<i>For the next generation...</i>

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:39.810
<i>Corona...</i>

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.990
<i>Blast!</i>

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:53.910
Sir Aldebaran!

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.240
This time,

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.210
you're done for, Taurus Saint!

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:09.170
<i>He released three Corona Blasts simultaneously.</i>

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.940
<i>His strength knows no bounds!</i>

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.530
Sir Aldebaran!

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:20.480
<i>But...</i>

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.160
<i>But you</i>

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:25.670
<i>cannot beat me!</i>

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.590
<i>Titan's Nova!</i>

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:38.990
<i>He flipped the ground?</i>

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.250
Is he...

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:21.830
No way! He took the attack and is still...

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:29.750
Why won't you finish me off?

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:33.000
Because you are not evil.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:41.010
I don't know what work you do for Hades, but...

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:46.170
you're just seeking out protectors
and roughing them up, is all.

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:49.850
You aren't cut out to be a Specter.

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:59.430
As far as I'm concerned,
Specters and Saints are all worthless.

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:03.290
I decide which enemies to kill
and which to protect.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.080
I already told you...

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.640
Mark my words, I will kill you!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:22.430
The sun's completely set.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.790
Aldebaran!

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:33.860
Sir Aldebaran!

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.150
Are you all right?

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:42.960
He was a tough guy!

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:44.780
I used my full strength for the
first time in a long while.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.790
You're in no shape to be laughing.

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:50.330
Let's go back to the Sanctuary.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.290
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:54.370
Let's go...

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.760
<i>Kagaho...</i>

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:07.440
<i>Where are you going back to?</i>

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:10.800
<i>Where?</i>

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:11.160
That a man with your abilities would be hurt so...

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:15.080
I, Taurus Aldebaran, have come to make a report.

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:20.170
As predicted, Lady Athena's
barrier shows signs of weakening.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:23.850
As Atla, the messenger from Jamir, said,

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:26.430
some of the Specters have revived.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.430
They have already been subdued,

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:31.110
and their bodies brought within
the protective confines.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:32.660
I see.

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:36.400
However, the Specter that injured you...

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.810
There are others, are there not?

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:39.320
You were here...

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.340
Sagittarius Sisyphos!

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:47.570
A man named Bennu, of the Heavenly Savage Star.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:50.010
He's unstable, but I would say

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:53.490
that he's as strong as the three lead Specters.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:55.210
The three major Specters?

00:12:55.210 --> 00:13:00.840
Yeah, but Sisyphos, how is Lady Athena?

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:06.160
She tries not to show it, but it can't be good.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:11.580
Lady Athena's barrier prevents
the immortal Specters from reviving.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.690
But it can't be easy to keep your Cosmo
so strong. All day and night.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:17.220
To maintain the barrier...

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:23.330
Lady Athena's body and soul
must be close to the breaking point.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:29.160
I must release her from
this pressure as soon as possible.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:41.950
Albafica has passed on,
and Asmita hasn't returned.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:44.420
And you are injured.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.850
What are you talking about?

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:48.340
Can't you see I'm in great shape?

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.230
You can't fool me.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:02.990
Take better care of yourself.

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:09.990
This may be a Holy War, but a Saint's death
would sadden Lady Athena.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:13.580
You have watched over Lady Athena
since she was a child.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.330
You would be most sensitive to that.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:43.670
It's true that I found Lady Athena,
who had been born in Italy,

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:46.230
and brought her to this Sanctuary.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:53.260
But now that her older brother,
Alone, has become Hades,

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:55.360
I am not sure that it was the right thing to do.

00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:01.080
When I see Lady Athena go
against her nature and fight,

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.580
my very soul hurts.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:06.340
Because, according to Lady Athena, Hades...

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.900
No, Alone is just like Pegasus Tenma.

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:12.400
Just an innocent boy.

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.280
Did you feel that?

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:22.730
Yes, a Cosmo as deep as the depths of darkness.

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:28.230
No...

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:33.740
No, it couldn't be...

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:52.260
The barrier...

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.280
It's been a long time, Athena.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:13.360
You are...

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:25.120
Big brother...

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:28.130
No, Athena.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:31.130
I am Hades, Lord of the Underworld.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.310
Is that... Standing on the Fire Clock...

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:12.660
No, it can't be...

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:15.970
Hades would not enter the Sanctuary himself.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.880
You bastard, Hades!

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:20.350
So you've come alone, to disrespect us!

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:24.060
The day you razed Tenma's hometown...

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.950
The frustration of that retreat...

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:37.280
We will never forget!

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:44.850
That you would dampen our reunion...

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:46.790
How unrefined of you Saints.

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.790
It's best if you stay still for a little while.

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.570
My body...

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:04.750
What...

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:07.600
Sisyphos! Aldebaran!

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:14.370
To think, we made it this far, and I can't move.

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:17.860
So this is the power of Hades!

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:27.250
Now, no one in the twelve houses can move.

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:30.580
It's been well over two hundred years,

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:32.080
Athena.

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:33.090
Big brother.

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:36.840
I am not your older brother.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.340
That's a lie!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.200
Have you forgotten?

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:44.350
There will always be a war between us.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:53.180
Placing such importance on
human memories. How foolish.

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:56.800
Is it not meaningless to live,
carrying the weight of sadness and suffering

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.610
on your shoulders?

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:01.740
No matter how human you may be...

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:07.250
Those long ago days, when you
were young, will never return.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.000
And who took away those days?

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.000
Me?!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:16.500
S-Sisyphos...

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.410
<i>This man...</i>

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:27.740
<i>Even I can't move under this pressure.</i>

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:29.390
<i>And he stood up!</i>

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:47.350
How dare you point an arrow at me, a god?

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:55.210
Foolish man...

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:05.550
I've seen you somewhere before.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.470
I'm sure...

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:32.660
You're the man who took Athena
from our village, five years ago.

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:36.130
It was logical that I should bring Lady Athena

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.670
to the Sanctuary, to protect her.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.170
But...

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.840
Athena, I wonder...

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:47.340
Why were you born in this day and age,

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:50.260
alongside Alone and Pegasus Tenma?

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:55.470
You put your human life on the line,

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:59.470
to protect that boy, possessed by Hades.

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:03.190
And?

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:08.490
I am Hades now.
The love of Athena was meaningless.

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:14.460
No, Hades. To us,
Lady Athena's love always represents

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:15.580
hope!

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:19.300
Fool.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:29.680
Sisyphos!

00:21:38.390 --> 00:21:39.410
Hades...

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:42.440
Hades!

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:46.570
Yes... Finally, you are acting
like a warrior goddess.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.420
<i>This light...</i>

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:04.170
<i>Teleportation?</i>

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:17.230
I've been waiting a long time for you, Tenma.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:19.760
Sorry for that, Alone.

00:22:19.760 --> 00:22:24.010
I've returned to kick your ass,
just like I promised!

00:24:03.660 --> 00:24:06.630
Sasha, I'm sorry it took me so long.

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:08.590
Everything's okay now.

00:24:09.180 --> 00:24:13.090
And Alone, the only reason I could fight until now,

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:15.850
was because of our promise that we three
would be together again.

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:21.430
But this is not what I wished for.

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:25.500
Next time on <i>Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas –</i>

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:26.440
<i>The Myth of Hades</i>...

00:24:27.540 --> 00:24:29.760
Unreachable.
